  "title": "序幕（四）：警报下的同行者",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "c001",
      "title": "警报与搜捕队",
      "time": "序幕三结束后，同一夜",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "kind": "background",
          "name": "bg_grandmother_bedroom_night",
          "placeholder": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "bgm",
          "name": "bgm_after_dream_quiet",
          "placeholder": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "raw": "CHECK: prologue_3_complete == true AND link_summoned == true [章节入口约束；未满足时不得接入本幕]",
          "meta": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "show",
          "actor": "男高",
          "asset": "char_male_high_normal",
          "position": "left",
          "placeholder": true,
          "pose": "坐在床沿，侧耳倾听",
          "expression": "疑惑"
        },
        {
          "kind": "show",
          "actor": "金发青年",
          "asset": "char_link_silent_placeholder",
          "position": "center",
          "placeholder": true,
          "pose": "站在床边，转向窗户",
          "expression": "警戒"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sfx",
          "name": "sfx_search_vehicle_alarm",
          "placeholder": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "stage",
          "text": "一阵短促的电子警报打破了房间里的安静。男高刚想继续问话，便看见窗帘边缘扫过一道白光。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "男高",
          "text": "外面怎么了？"
        },
        {
          "kind": "stage",
          "text": "他掀起窗帘一角。街口停着一辆深色车辆，几个穿黑制服的人正拿着金属装置沿路查看。那身衣服，他昨晚才在仓库区见过。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "男高",
          "text": "……又是他们。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "stage",
          "text": "金发青年走到窗侧，避开扫来的灯光，朝男高做了个退后一点的手势。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "hide",
          "actor": "男高"
        },
        {
          "kind": "hide",
          "actor": "金发青年"
        },
        {
          "kind": "background",
          "name": "bg_old_residential_search_night",
          "placeholder": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "stage",
          "text": "街口，队员按住耳机，盯着装置上迅速变淡的反应。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "搜捕通讯",
          "text": "梦境反应确认。位置在这片住宅区。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "搜捕通讯",
          "text": "反应刚刚中断。实验体还没有找到，分组继续搜索。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "stage",
          "text": "一支小队转向街道另一端，另一支留在岔路口。灯光掠过紧闭的店门与墙角，搜捕没有随着警报停止。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "background",
          "name": "bg_grandmother_bedroom_night",
          "placeholder": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "show",
          "actor": "男高",
          "asset": "char_male_high_normal",
          "position": "left",
          "placeholder": true,
          "pose": "站在窗边，松开窗帘",
          "expression": "戒备"
        },
        {
          "kind": "show",
          "actor": "金发青年",
          "asset": "char_link_silent_placeholder",
          "position": "center",
          "placeholder": true,
          "pose": "站在窗侧，避开灯光",
          "expression": "警戒"
        },
        {
          "kind": "stage",
          "text": "男高松开窗帘，回头看了一眼通向楼下的房门。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jump",
          "target": "c002"
        }
      ],
